                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div className="bg-white p-8 rounded-[32px] border shadow-sm flex items-center gap-5">
                      <div className="p-5 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-2xl"><Award size={28} /></div>
                      <div>
